invalid type: string "Powerful for tabular data (XGBoost, LightGBM, CatBoost).\n\n9.3 Stacking – slides 67–72\n\nDefinition\nCombine different types of models by using a meta-learner on their outputs.\n\nProcess:\n\nTrain several base models (RF, GBDT, MLP, etc.).\n\nFor each example, collect their predictions → feature vector.\n\nexisting learners.\n\nach learner j:\n\ndual image.\n\nn\nn\n